# promptfoo (eval-only dev tooling) pins its node engine to `^20.20.0 || >=22.22.0`.
# Our self-hosted CI runner and local dev use node 22.17.x, which trips yarn's engine
# check even though promptfoo is never imported by the app, lint, typecheck, or tests.
# Ignore engine checks so `yarn install` succeeds; the runtime code stays on node 22.
ignore-engines true
